/-! ### Choice of the delays (blueprint lines 1732-1733)

Delays are truncated geometric: `P(D = n) = 2^{-(n+1)}` for `n < d₀` and `P(D = d₀) = 2^{-d₀}`.
A single round is marked with probability at least `1/66` once `|X| ≤ 2^{d₀ - 5}`: raising the
delay of a top scorer by five marks the round, injectively, at a weight cost at most `2^{-5}`. -/

                                                       
                                                          
                                                                        

                                                                       
                                        

                                                       
                                                                         
                                        
                                        
                                
                   
                              
                        
                                                            
                                      
               
                                                                     
                                                  
          

                                    
                                               
                                                                                       
                                         
                                                                               
                                                                                           
                         
                                                                                  
                          
                                        
                                                                            
                                        
                                    
                                     
                                     
                                                    
      

                                                                     
                                           
                  

                                                                         
                                                                           
                                                                   
              
                                    
                          
                                
                                                                     
                             
                                                                                              
          
          
                                                                     

